### Browser extension ###
# "Pack extension" in Chrome writes these next to the extension folder. The .pem is the
# extension's private signing key and must never be published.
*.pem
*.crx
# What "npx web-ext build" and "web-ext sign" write: the zip and the signed .xpi
web-ext-artifacts/

